---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/Renaissance-Main-Image.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A perpetual student of everything"
	pubDate={new Date('September 27 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Vivek. I'm a curious person with a condition that compels me to learn something new and interesting every day. 
		If I don't, my head might explode.
	</p>

	<p>
		From the mysteries of physics and mathematics to the workings of computers and engineering, I find 
		everything that is intellectually stimulating to be interesting. 
	</p>

	<p>
		This website is my attempt to satisfy that curiosity, 
		document what I learn, and share some of the things I find along the way.
	</p>

	<p>
		I don't claim expertise in everything that I write about; I am here to explore,
		experiment, and understand everything from scratch.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you're someone who enjoys wandering down intellectual rabbit holes, 
		questioning how things work, or simply learning something new for the sheer joy of it, 
		I hope you'll find something interesting here.
		After all, the world is far too fascinating to stick to just one subject.
	</p>
</Layout>
